    "summary": "Strategic Ploy, 1 CP. Use it in the opposing player's Movement phase as soon as an enemy unit has finished a move (Normal, Advance or Fall Back). Pick a HERETIC ASTARTES DAEMON VEHICLE or VASHTORR THE ARKIFANE unit of yours that is outside Engagement Range of all enemy units and no more than 8\" away from that enemy unit. It may immediately move up to 6\" as a Normal move, and it has to finish that move as near as it can get to that enemy unit.",
